Crate Delight for Horizon 26.3 (version 26.07.01-horizon.3)

A port of Crate Delight 26.07.01-1.20-fabric by Axperty.
Original source: https://github.com/axperty/cratedelight
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: a content package (no code). The items, blocks, textures, models and data
are carried over from the original jar and converted to Horizon's content format. This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE (the
original jar's LICENSE_cratedelight).

It works on its own. Its pumpkin slice crate is crafted from the farmersdelight package's (Farmer's
Delight for Horizon) pumpkin slices, and its peanut crate and salt and cinnamon bags from the
expandeddelight package's items: those recipes work when the packages are installed too.
